2026-10-24T02:06:54.2731685Z Linux USB/IP device management (experimental preview)
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2731958Z 
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2732052Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2732211Z 
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2732280Z Commands:
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2732554Z   logs                Read sanitized stored logs or authorized agent audit projections
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2733041Z   agent               Run or query the nonroot shared application service using fixed profiles
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2733613Z   secure-server       Serve configured devices with mandatory mutual TLS and per-device authorization
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2734480Z   secure-discover     Read the stable-key device catalog over the configured mutually authenticated TLS endpoint
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2735162Z   secure-attach       Import the configured stable device key and own its encrypted VHCI relay until stopped
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2735786Z   native-pending      Inspect unresolved secure Native channels through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2736398Z   native-reconcile    Verify a stopped Native channel and retire its record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2736991Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T02:06:54.2737610Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
